{"channelId":"UC_ujoh5dVXSisqEuu6N-4TQ","row":["International Animal Rescue Goa",5,"International Animal Rescue Goa was established as a charity (Registration No : 106/GOA/98) in August 1998. Our aim is to reduce the terrible suffering of animals in Goa.\n\nSince we began this vital work, International Animal Rescue Goa, has sterilized more than 30,000 dogs, 11,000 cats, and vaccinated over 60,000 dogs against rabies. Our ambulances have collected thousands of road casualties and we have made a major impact on mange, which causes intense suffering and was endemic within the street dog community. We rescue dozens of animals from wells every year, have rescued hundreds of snakes from houses and snake charmers which would otherwise have been killed or died, and do our best to educate the public on animal welfare issues.\n\nhttp://www.internationalanimalrescuegoa.org.in","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_ujoh5dVXSisqEuu6N-4TQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_ujoh5dVXSisqEuu6N-4TQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:03.417Z","channelId":"UC_ujoh5dVXSisqEuu6N-4TQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"076773c56295ad86ea4ff7707cd93c0ed8e75a76eff9120132a12d1ecadb4408","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"2cb43dcee32b9a89e56a2307942218ca2efbea531f1bb51759062424be3bac5d"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_ujoh5dVXSisqEuu6N-4TQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":5,"raw":"5 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_ujoh5dVXSisqEuu6N-4TQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:03.417Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_ujoh5dVXSisqEuu6N-4TQ"]}],"cleanup